3
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:26,000
"One Direction: This Is Us" is a captivating and intimate all-access
look at life on the road for the global music phenomenon.

4
00:20:26,666 --> 00:20:32,666
Weaved with stunning live concert footage, this inspiring feature film tells the remarkable story of Niall, Zayn, Liam, Harry and Louis' meteoric rise to
fame, from their humble hometown beginnings and competing on the X-Factor, to conquering the world and performing at London’s famed O2 Arena.

5
00:25:33,333 --> 00:25:39,333
